The images bundle third-party software, each under its own licence: README.adoc
lists every component and its licence, SOURCES.md the corresponding source of the
GPL binaries that do not come from Debian packages. Some components may only be
used with the vendor's chips:

- STM32Cube CMSIS device files (Apache-2.0) and HAL drivers (BSD-3-Clause), from
  STMicroelectronics' GitHub repositories;
- nRF Connect SDK and nrfxlib (LicenseRef-Nordic-5-Clause): only with a Nordic
  Semiconductor integrated circuit; binaries must not be reverse engineered;
- nrf_cc310_bl (ARM Object Code and Header Files Licence): only for applications
  targeted at an ARM-based product.

Not included, installed by the user on first start under the vendor's licence:
STM32CubeCLT (ST SLA0048), nrfutil (LicenseRef-Nordic-1-Clause), SEGGER J-Link.
